{"parentUuid":"9e82adc1-c6aa-4f9d-b2e8-dca98708016b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"72013b54-b18f-48cf-ab14-3227cd513d22","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018KE8fpWKdD2LccBVmvhnqb","type":"tool_result","content":": \n60: **Password sign-in: any 400 is \"That password is wrong.\"**\n117: **JusPrin's model list.**\n185: **Printer profiles shipped with the app fail to install or read.**\n209: **The local tool server's helper tells the outside AI client to open JusPrin when JusPrin is open.**\n223: **A damaged printer-facts file is emptied with no word.**\n248: **A printer-host connection test that throws.**\n281: **Sign out with no network.**\n320: **Own key: the service is down or overloaded.**\n334: **The app sends something the server refuses** (a field a newer app added, a model removed from the\n345: **A paid Chargebee event that matches nothing.**\n353: **Guesses in billing.** Three if/else changes. The not-found case and the deletion stop were run only\n368: **The browser session is gone at checkout, or on the way back from paying.**\n376: **A wrong-scope or wrong-client token is told \"Sign in to JusPrin to continue.\"**\n390: **JusPrin 1: a cancelled checkout raises a 500.**\n406: **JusPrin 1 checkout: a bare catch drops the Obico Pro discount.**\n413: **JusPrin 1 plan read: any failure answers a 500 with \"Failed to retrieve subscription plan\".**\n431: **A report photo in HEIC, or the server failing to read the upload.**","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"0dc45d4d-d733-4e42-abb2-58b1bb9bd964","timestamp":"2026-11-25T18:39:44.038Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":": \n60: **Password sign-in: any 400 is \"That password is wrong.\"**\n117: **JusPrin's model list.**\n185: **Printer profiles shipped with the app fail to install or read.**\n209: **The local tool server's helper tells the outside AI client to open JusPrin when JusPrin is open.**\n223: **A damaged printer-facts file is emptied with no word.**\n248: **A printer-host connection test that throws.**\n281: **Sign out with no network.**\n320: **Own key: the service is down or overloaded.**\n334: **The app sends something the server refuses** (a field a newer app added, a model removed from the\n345: **A paid Chargebee event that matches nothing.**\n353: **Guesses in billing.** Three if/else changes. The not-found case and the deletion stop were run only\n368: **The browser session is gone at checkout, or on the way back from paying.**\n376: **A wrong-scope or wrong-client token is told \"Sign in to JusPrin to continue.\"**\n390: **JusPrin 1: a cancelled checkout raises a 500.**\n406: **JusPrin 1 checkout: a bare catch drops the Obico Pro discount.**\n413: **JusPrin 1 plan read: any failure answers a 500 with \"Failed to retrieve subscription plan\".**\n431: **A report photo in HEIC, or the server failing to read the upload.**","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9e82adc1-c6aa-4f9d-b2e8-dca98708016b","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Library/Application Support/Claude/side-session-notes/local_cd3120f7-030a-4af8-a6d1-28ecae789f1a","sessionId":"b575a9e5-080c-46d7-b71a-f5842e099a04","version":"2.1.330","gitBranch":"claude/misrouted-failures","slug":"linear-finding-kay-of-b575a9e5-080c-46d7-b71a-f5842e099a04","dataFlowOn":true}
