olved service tier is not allo\n== reports:\nNone\nSlic3r::GUI::JusPrin::Agent::UnexpectedServiceAnswer: OpenAI answered HTTP 400 (request p-237f61ea5f0e8169-d637ba90b24b392b-c-2-m-2-attempt-1 #1): {\"error\":{\"message\":\"The requested or resolved service tier is not allowed for the project.\",\"type\":\"invalid_request_error\",\"param\":\"service_tier\",\"code\":null}}\n##### says-oa-403-country\n== page was told:\n\"got\": \"assistant_failed\", \"payload\": {\"error\": {\"code\": \"unexpected_error\", \"message\": \"Something went wrong on our side\", \"retryable\": true}, \"messageId\": \"m-2\"}}\n== stand-in answered:\n{\"t\": 1795637307.510918, \"key\": \"POST /ent/jusprin/v2/responses\", \"answer\": [403, \"{\\\"error\\\":{\\\"message\\\":\\\"Country, region, or territory not supported\\\",\\\"typ\n== reports:\nNone\nSlic3r::GUI::JusPrin::Agent::UnexpectedServiceAnswer: OpenAI answered HTTP 403 (request p-8ca685fcb54a77bf-d61ff9e3787c1d7e-c-2-m-2-attempt-1 #1): {\"error\":{\"message\":\"Country, region, or territory not supported\",\"type\":\"request_forbidden\",\"param\":null,\"code\":\"unsupported_country_region_territory\"}}\n##### says-oa-400-ours\n== page was told:\n\"got\": \"assistant_failed\", \"payload\": {\"error\": {\"code\": \"unexpected_error\", \"message\": \"Something went wrong on our side\", \"retryable\": true}, \"messageId\": \"m-2\"}}\n== stand-in answered:\n{\"t\": 1795637322.439126, \"key\": \"POST /ent/jusprin/v2/responses\", \"answer\": [400, \"{\\\"error\\\":{\\\"message\\\":\\\"Unknown parameter: 'foo'.\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"invalid_requ\n== reports:\nNone\nSlic3r::GUI::JusPrin::Agent::UnexpectedServiceAnswer: OpenAI answered HTTP 400 (request p-2ed1942d812a3dec-18893e220eb47400-c-2-m-2-attempt-1 #1): {\"error\":{\"message\":\"Unknown parameter: 'foo'.\",\"type\":\"invalid_request_error\",\"param\":\"foo\",\"code\":\"unknown_parameter\"}}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sandboxed":false,"so