es to whoever can do something about it\nfd7127e424 Chats can run on a model on this computer, in Ollama or LM Studio\n110a9492e0 The Windows dialog for a 3D view OpenGL cannot start in is translated\na142e0b4f3 A tool call refused for text that is too long says which text and the limit\n\nClaude Code attached this context automatically; it isn't part of the user's message. It describes the user's own account and workspace, so they don't need it reported back.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"user","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/misrouted-failures","sessionId":"b575a9e5-080c-46d7-b71a-f5842e099a04","version":"2.1.330","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"linear-finding-kay-of-b575a9e5-080c-46d7-b71a-f5842e099a04","dataFlowOn":true}
