{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"b575a9e5-080c-46d7-b71a-f5842e099a04","id":"5930c5cb-e4f0-4a8f-a245-ebe58c57beb8","timestamp":"2026-11-25T20:33:22.767Z","version":"2.1.330","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"537aa7fef3809f8906edeb3e1ec2f830d036da72a57cef626acaea224b4bc68a","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"high"}},"base":"d784b070-d1a0-4a38-a934-1980b3bfefb1","keep":17,"tail":["4819d04de9c0eb56d48ed4ee8f401fc38a260908e4d030525bcdecab6b41a31f","0768fb101e21270c4a8e878a79ca3eee44593389ac6c18fe05a2a916a2e53267","8d5417819870814c986d7076932ad2dcad28287bdd05a674772b4c6ce5fb42e5"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",19,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"98eb8ca01947bd92cee1d748b9f8938a83f9fc6b4c741e584d6a7401c7fb9ee6"}
{"type":"data-flow-records","v":1,"sessionId":"b575a9e5-080c-46d7-b71a-f5842e099a04","records":[{"response_id":"msg_011ChQHRZgSwogfEToTY5Guc","listed":["msg_011ChQHRASDFDpPznx1epks3"]}]}
{"parentUuid":"bb7acdea-bd08-4cde-9c48-aaea7b832369","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChQHRZgSwogfEToTY5Guc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've added the line that shows another side's own words, `%1% says: “%2%”`, and used it in 3 places. I saw each one fail in a scratch copy of the app before the change and work after it. Six other places are left as they were, each with its reason in the write-up. Nothing is committed or pushed. The work is uncommitted in the `misrouted-failures` worktree, and the new file `Support/SaidBy.hpp` is untracked.\n\n**Changed:**\n- **A person's own AI service refuses a chat.** A 403 or a 429 that comes with message text, and OpenAI's 400 for a `service_tier` the project's settings don't allow, now show the service's words. Before, they were reported to us as \"Something went wrong on our side\", except the 429, which showed a fixed \"rate limited\" sentence. Other 400, 404 and 422 answers still come to us.\n- **The AI key check in Preferences and first-run setup.** This is the Sentry report JUSPRIN-APP-E: an OpenRouter workspace that accepts only the person's own provider keys answered the key check with a 404. The person now sees OpenRouter's words, which name the setting and its address, and nothing is reported.\n- **Exporting kept G-code from Print history to a read-only card.** Before, this was reported and the person saw nothing. Now a dialog shows \"macOS says: “/Volumes/JPCARD: Read-only file system”\", and nothing is reported.\n\n**Left as they were:**\n- An attachment that cannot be read: the code never gets the system's reason.\n- Export, restore and version history: export gets no reason from the system, and restore and history work in the app's own folder, not one the person chose.\n- The projects folder: the check repeats every second.\n- Opening a project: the reason is lost several calls down, and showing it would need a stored field.\n- Autosave and the proposal card: you said to leave them.\n\n**Checks:**\n- `agent_bridge_tests` (650 cases), `jusprin_tests` (200) and `jusprin_profile_tests` (20) all pass.\n- clang-tidy, AgentUI vitest (845 tests) and HomeUI vitest (169 tests) all pass.\n- The 3 new or changed agent tests fail on the old code.\n- The G-code export has no unit test, so the live run is its only evidence.\n- The line is translated in all 22 native catalogs, marked `# AI Translated`.\n\nThe write-up is `misrouted-failures-says-changes.md` and the full diff is `misrouted-failures-says-changes-app.patch`, both in the shared notes folder. I've sent the counts to the session that started this work."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":322,"cache_read_input_tokens":128682,"output_tokens":857,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":322,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":857,"cache_read_input_tokens":128682,"cache_creation_input_tokens":322,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":322},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"341cd541-93ed-4ff7-b374-82e65b50e893","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011ChQHRZW356qVhwXE9bvk3","requestRef":"5930c5cb-e4f0-4a8f-a245-ebe58c57beb8","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"61ce921b-1b41-410c-8c0a-d5b24fb20ee4","timestamp":"2026-11-25T20:33:32.016Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","madeBy":"model","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-de